 away to school where he was taunted as a half-caste by the now openly anti-Western Chinese. His father served the pro-Japanese government while active in the Resistance. At their summer villa in Beidalhe, the family surreptitiously aided the guerillas in the nearby mountains. And in Qingdao, young David was befriended by the Japanese next door while his father hid a wounded U.S. airman in their house.\".","thumbnailUrl":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/1912058-L.jpg","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Sino-Japanese Conflict, 1937-1945","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Childhood and youth","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"History","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Sino-Japanese War, 1937-1945","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Enfance et jeunesse","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Histoire","sourceId":"source-open-library-things-that-must-not-be-forgotten-a-childhood-in-wartime-china-michael-david-kwan"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Conflit sino-japonais","s